Come on.

72
00:04:19,170 --> 00:04:21,050
不。看，这就是我们所有的。
No. Look, that's all we've got.

73
00:04:23,090 --> 00:04:25,410
自行车。
Bikes.

74
00:04:27,050 --> 00:04:30,450
“我和詹姆斯还有点道理”。
'James and I did have a point.

75
00:04:30,450 --> 00:04:38,010
“因为在越南车子太贵，
'Because cars are so expensive
in Vietnam,

