1104
01:05:03,770 --> 01:05:05,970
那就是方向，你这蠢瓜！
It's that way, you blithering idiot!

1105
01:05:05,970 --> 01:05:08,050
‘然后他撞进了网子。’
'Then he crashed into some netting.'

1106
01:05:08,050 --> 01:05:09,730
哎呀，真倒霉！
Oh, bloody hell!

1107
01:05:10,930 --> 01:05:12,970
‘接着，当哈蒙德和我起动时……’
'And then as Hammond
