01:05:58,850 --> 01:06:03,010
越南船只建造
结绳技术
把一切绑在一起
Vietnamese boat-building
knot technology
to lash it all together

1122
01:06:03,010 --> 01:06:07,610
让它更有浮力，
防止船尾掉进
水里并且阻止进水。
to give me more buoyancy,
stop the stern falling into
the water and stop it filling up.

