including the frame on the boat,
the frame of the bike...

1168
01:08:48,650 --> 01:08:50,850
我们的自行车滑雪板简直一塌糊涂。
'Our bike-skis were in a bad way.'

1169
01:08:50,850 --> 01:08:52,290
来吧！
Come on!

1170
01:08:52,290 --> 01:08:55,010
不过，随后……
'But then...'

1171
